{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are planning a birthday party for your grandad, who is 70. Do you choose a quiet afternoon with a short walk, or a busy games day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Quiet afternoon","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Busy games day","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You pick a quiet afternoon with a short walk. Grandad enjoys it and tells you stories about his childhood."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You pick a busy games day. Grandad gets tired quickly, so you rest often and make sure he has water."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
